config BR2_PACKAGE_DAWOS_DSPBENCH
	bool "dawos-dspbench"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  A measurement tool, not product code: it times a cascade of
	  second-order filters in AVX2, the kernel of the reference load
	  of requirement R-04 (ADR 0011), on the CPU it is bound to.
	  Experiment E-06 runs it on a performance core and on an
	  efficiency core to measure the ratio between the two.

	  Installs the program as /usr/libexec/dawos/dspbench; the
	  script dawos-dspbench of the root file system overlay runs it.
